window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What if Mistborn and Treasure Planet had a baby—and that baby stole an airship? In the floating world of Sora, magic isn’t wielded—it’s lived, breathed, and burned. Valeo’s the last of his kind—a luck-bending thief forged by loss. Breeze is fury incarnate—bloodied fists a vow to the family that left her behind. Falling in with a patchwork Corsair crew, these would-be pirates uncover a storybook ship and a thousand-year heist still haunting the skies. Pitted against vicious Timeless tyrants, ruthless cutthroats, and unspeakable Darksky horrors, it’s a powderkeg race toward one impossible choice: Steal the sky… or watch it fall. A cinematic saga for fans of Sanderson, Bardugo, Rothfuss, and Final Fantasy.</p>"; 
